{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有：Y在S01、S03、S13等处压缩了部分心理因果，少了X中“甜蜜却仍拿不准”“想确认对方是否也一样”“明知无人能保证永远”等关键转折，人物内心的解释略薄一层。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"X\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y的话句更短，重点加亮后容易迅速抓住每段的心理变化；感受部分又有具体的声部、节奏、身体反应和情绪变化，且水波、小船、摇荡等意象贯穿前后，结尾对开头的回应也让整段经历更完整。X的心理解释更充分，但长句需要花时间读，感受词也相对缺少音乐过程中的细节变化。综合边听边扫的实际体验，我选Y，但它确实牺牲了一部分人物心理转折的完整性。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad4d2307-5281-44f9-b3b0-4b07f0a0b1cd", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T200933348578Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.969, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T20:10:57.330435+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "356a7b0f6afa278e7a1245252c491537d4654ad665a7ad8e32ca31218ec92c67", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f45